ass=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Platte County runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids August to September came in under 90% of normal in 36 of them. In 2025 that same pair hit just 37% of normal on the middle of the grids, while June to July ran 133%. Grid 23540 had its driest year in 1988 at 45% of normal. So far in 2026 the middle of the grids shows March to April at 147% and April to May at 141%.</p>"}
